playstyle=\"true\" scriptlevel=\"0\"><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mn>2</mn></mfrac></mstyle><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mo>−</mo><mn>4</mn><mi>x</mi><msup><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>+</mo><mstyle displaystyle=\"true\" scriptlevel=\"0\"><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mn>3</mn></mfrac></mstyle><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mo>−</mo><mn>4</mn><mi>x</mi><msup><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mn>3</mn></msup><mo>−</mo><mstyle displaystyle=\"true\" scriptlevel=\"0\"><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mn>4</mn></mfrac></mstyle><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mo>−</mo><mn>4</mn><mi>x</mi><msup><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mn>4</mn></msup><mo>+</mo><mo>⋯</mo></mtd></mtr><mtr><mtd></mtd><mtd><mi></mi><mo>=</mo><mo>−</mo><mn>4</mn><mi>x</mi><mo>−</mo><mstyle displaystyle=\"true\" scriptlevel=\"0\"><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mn>2</mn></mfrac></mstyle><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mn>16</mn><msup><mi>x</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo>+</mo><mstyle displaystyle=\"true\" scriptlevel=\"0\"><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mn>3</mn></mfrac></mstyle><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mo>−</mo><mn>64</mn><msup><mi>x</mi><mn>3</mn></msup><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo>−</mo><mstyle displaystyle=\"true\" scriptlevel=\"0\"><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mn>4</mn></mfrac></mstyle><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mn>256</mn><msup><mi>x</mi><mn>4</mn></msup><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo>+</mo><mo>⋯</mo></mtd></mtr><mtr><mtd></mtd><mtd><mi></mi><mo>=</mo><mo>−</mo><mn>4</mn><mi>x</mi><mo>−</mo><mn>8</mn><msup><mi>x</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>−</mo><mstyle displaystyle=\"true\" scriptlevel=\"0\"><mfrac><mrow><mn>64</mn><msup><mi>x</mi><mn>3</mn></msup></mrow><mn>3</mn></mfrac></mstyle><mo>−</mo><mn>64</mn><msup><mi>x</mi><mn>4</mn></msup><mo>+</mo><mo>⋯</mo></mtd></mtr></mtable></math></mjx-assistive-mml></mjx-container></p>\n<p>Finally, we add the two series to give the desired result:</p>\n<p><mjx-container class=\"MathJax CtxtMenu_Attached_0\" jax=\"CHTML\" display=\"true\" tabindex=\"0\" ctxtmenu_counter=\"178\" style=\"font-si